<英文法規名稱>Amendments to the Regulations Governing Preferential Admission for Academic Advancement for Students with Outstanding Achievements in International Mathematics or Science Olympiads and International Science Fairs</英文法規名稱>
<中文法規名稱>參加國際數理學科奧林匹亞競賽及國際科學展覽成績優良學生升學優待辦法</中文法規名稱>
